":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":2802166610,"text":"そうか。","nextNodeIds":[721100305]},{"nodeId":721100305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":3269615002,"text":"今時、岩蔵流を名乗る人がまだいるのか。宗主は物にならない人なのに。","nextNodeIds":[721100306]},{"nodeId":721100306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":256086226,"text":"岩蔵光造だ。ここで剣術の指南役を務めている。お前は？","nextNodeIds":[721100307]},{"nodeId":721100307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2919669538,"text":"#{NICKNAME}。","nextNodeIds":[721100308]},{"nodeId":721100308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":3049802258,"text":"三船、丹波…彼らに会ったのかい？岡崎兄弟も。","nextNodeIds":[721100309]},{"nodeId":721100309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":2417656930,"text":"それと片山。彼は勝負をする前に、試合に名を付けるのが好きだ。","nextNodeIds":[721100310]},{"nodeId":721100310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":1611968058,"text":"「将来本物の剣豪になったら、すべての試合は本に書かれるものだ」って。はははっ、本当に突拍子もない発想だな…","nextNodeIds":[721100311]},{"nodeId":721100311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":2181759602,"text":"そうだ、それにあの島田だ。「永胤」から「光胤」へ、時代が移り変わっても、「初伝」を突破できなかった。","nextNodeIds":[721100312]},{"nodeId":721100312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":3153861978,"text":"彼らは将軍様の「目狩り令」を理解できないため、逃げ道を選んだようだ。","nextNodeIds":[721100313]},{"nodeId":721100313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":2849541330,"text":"過去彼らに剣術を教えた頃のこと、懐かしいな。俺はなぜ閉館して軍に入ったのだろう？","nextNodeIds":[721100314]},{"nodeId":721100314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":1433671010,"text":"#{NICKNAME}、彼らの腕前はどうだ？","nextNodeIds":[721100315,721100316]},{"nodeId":721100315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1319866034,"text":"残念だった…","nextNodeIds":[721100317]},{"nodeId":721100317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":1519283746,"text":"そっか…","nextNodeIds":[721100318]},{"nodeId":721100318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":1058136106,"text":"#では、{NICKNAME}、お前の師匠は誰なんだ？土門？それとも渋川の流派？まさか鳴神本人？","nextNodeIds":[721100319]},{"nodeId":721100319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":91069450,"text":"「我流」。","nextNodeIds":[721100320]},{"nodeId":721100320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":3692698482,"text":"なるほど。","nextNodeIds":[721100321]},{"nodeId":721100321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":3236329386,"text":"岩蔵流も、とうとう俺の代で没落してしまったか。自ら教えた弟子は、師匠もいない人に試合で負けるとはな。","nextNodeIds":[721100322]},{"nodeId":721100322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1577915314,"text":"…","nextNodeIds":[721100323]},{"nodeId":721100323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":2270938492,"text":"そうか、分かった。","nextNodeIds":[721100324]},{"nodeId":721100324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":1049027898,"text":"お前の流派は何であろうと、もうどうでもいい。","nextNodeIds":[721100325]},{"nodeId":721100325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":3050169498,"text":"岩蔵流も、とうとう俺の代で没落してしまったか。自ら教えた弟子は、試合で流派も名乗らない人に負けるとはな。","nextNodeIds":[721100326]},{"nodeId":721100326,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":955350298,"text":"大成はしていないが、俺は一応岩蔵流の宗主だ。剣客として、「岩蔵光胤」と呼ばれている。","nextNodeIds":[721100327]},{"nodeId":721100327,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":3275662826,"text":"秘剣の心得はもう覚えていない、「神の目」も将軍様にお渡しした…","nextNodeIds":[721100328]},{"nodeId":721100328,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":3646517754,"text":"…だが、この失墜に甘んじず、逆らった道を歩むならば、","nextNodeIds":[721100329]},{"nodeId":721100329,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":506656498,"text":"不器用でも、お前に負けたあの門下生たちの仇を討つ人情が俺にはまだある。","nextNodeIds":[721100330]},{"nodeId":721100330,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20297,"speakerName":"岩蔵光造","textMapHash":1717104858,"text":"ここは狭い。お前の剣技も披露しにくいだろう。ついてこい。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":721100316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2085853474,"text":"勉強になった。","nextNodeIds":[721100317]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7211003,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7211007,"order":9,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":0,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"fin_7211007"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[7211002],"talks":[{"talkId":7211002,"talkConfig":{"checkAction